                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "36288032",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198028932184",
                            "num_reviews": 57,
                            "playtime_forever": 1091,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 649,
                            "last_played": 1558838298
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Well... I REALLY love the songs and the characters. But this game is all about physics, and the physics are broken. It's not a matter about that it's impossible to beat all the levels or even to beat all of them with 3 stars. The point is, it looks like some old bad 8 bit games, where one \"tenth of inch\" out of the right position in the right time will kill you.\nI will keep playing it, by the whole 240 levels (a bit too much?), but if you don't like games where the controls are part of the challenge, stay away from here, please.\nP.S. The achievements \"get 3 stars on all levels of world X\" are broken too. Just get the first level with 3 stars and you unlock the achievement...",
